	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"eval", exp="g.no251=1"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat760010c"},
		line=1559,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“''Tis not my place to speak on the matter.'”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hah, you sounded just like him.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Never thought I'd ever hear Soujin talking like that.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My mind just went blank.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"The next day─",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"The girls waste no time in making fun of my gaffe.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Well, at any rate, we should thank our lucky stars that nobody died yesterday.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Though if weren't for Soujin, I'd probably be pushing up daisies right now, ahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's not funny.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Predictably, the attack on the Government-General last night was perpetrated by the anti-peace faction.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Thankfully, we suffered no casualties on our side while managing to rout them.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"And apparently, the last of their members were rounded up this morning following a raid on their base of operations.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"The trade negotiations were temporarily suspended due to the attack, but they're set to resume tomorrow in a new location.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Well, even if they took me out, the Group has plenty of successors lined up to take my place.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“If anything, I'd say it was a pretty valuable experience.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Shino.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha, sorry, sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Shino chuckles without a seeming care in the world even as Hotori scowls sullenly at her.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Sensing a lull in the conversation, Akari sets her teacup down.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“At any rate, I'm just glad nobody got hurt.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin was there to protect Shino, and Hotori and Elsa kept Kanami safe.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well, yeah...”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Hotori trails off, sipping at her tea with a frown.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Say, do you all remember?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A while back, Elsa said that our little student council would go on to shape the future of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sure I do, but what's your point?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That turned out to be totally true, didn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now that you mention it...”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This just might be the most prestigious student council in the history of the academy.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Let's see... We've got ourselves the Empress, the governor-general, the first prime minister─”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm still just a candidate.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then we have the head of the Empire's biggest conglomerate, the Executor of the warriors, and the Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"A star-studded lineup, to be sure.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And last but not least, a tofu-loving warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That really isn't the most flattering title.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Well, let's leave it at that for now.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Changing the subject, huh?",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Shino rummages around her bag before pulling out a single sheet of paper.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"She holds out the official-seeming document towards me.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Wanna marry me?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Akari & Hotori"},
			{
"“Pffft!” “Pffft!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"The two girls spit out their tea at the exact same time.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“*Cough, cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Wh-What are you saying, Shino?!”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Meanwhile, I'm at a loss for words.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Did I really hear that right?",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"But no matter how many times I check, the document\nshe's holding out to me is indeed a marriage certificate.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"And Shino's already written her name on the dotted line.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You two were like that?”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“S-Since when?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait, we're not.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yeah, we're not.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Still, Shino makes no move to put the marriage certificate away.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"I meet her keen eyes with a questioning look.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"As soon as she notices my gaze, she blinks rapidly before turning aside.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Shino, what's going on here?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I've got my reasons.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Y'see, I was thinking of taking on Republican citizenship for the sake of the Kurushima Group.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“From now on, the Empire's economy isn't gonna be able to survive without trade with the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And if it's trade we're talking about, the Kurushima Group is sure to be in the thick of things.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I get that, but what does any of that have to do with marrying Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hey, keep your pants on. I'm getting to that.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Shino nonchalantly takes a sip of her tea.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Long story short, I'm gonna do everything I can to corner the market, but being an Imperial is gonna put me on the back foot when I'm dealing with the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'd go as far as to forsake your citizenship for the sake of business?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's not just for making a quick buck, but for the future of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Any day now, Republican capital is gonna start flowing into the Empire like nobody's business.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And the minute they make us out to be an easy mark, it'll be like blood in the water.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“They'll swallow up the Empire's economy in no time flat.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“This is the new battlefield we're faced with.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's totally different from the war three years ago. Now, it's our culture that's at stake if we lose.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Even though we were defeated three years ago, we were at least able to retain our identity and way of life.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"But now, even that is under threat from the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I-Is it really that bad?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm just talking about the worst-case scenario.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“But the only way to fight back against an economic invasion is with your own financial muscle.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That's why I'm planning to take the fight to the Republic and start gobbling up their economic pie.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“But y'know, that's where my citizenship starts being a problem.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Because being an Imperial citizen puts you at a disadvantage, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Shino nods.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And so, I figured all my problems would go away as soon as I became a Republican.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Seriously? Changing citizenship like a set of clothes...”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Ahaha, you know me. I've always been fond of taking the easy way out.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Maybe you could say I got that from my parents!”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Shino cackles with laughter at her own joke.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"That free spirit of hers surely does come from her mixed Republican-Imperial heritage.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So basically, you want to take on Republican citizenship in order to make it easier to break into the Republic's markets?”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You know it.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Still, what does any of that have to do with getting married to me?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Shino sets the marriage certificate down on the table.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“The problem is that if I take on Republican citizenship, it'll be the Imperials that start having misgivings about dealing with us.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“But if I take you as my groom, I can nip that in the bud.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
{"font", size=43},
"“You're a well-known warrior, plus you've got connections to all the\nEmpire's movers and shakers; the governor-general, the Empress, the\nwarriors' kingpin, the Exalt-Priestess, and our soon-to-be prime minister.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I really couldn't ask for anyone better if I wanna strengthen my ties to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Soujin, you're my only hope! Won't you marry me for the sake of the Empire?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"For the sake of the Empire, huh?",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"I can tell how serious Shino is based on how she conducted herself at the trade negotiations yesterday.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"But still, to get married just like that...",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if it's for the sake of the Empire, are ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"you",
{"/font"},
" okay with this?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Marriage is about more than status and politics.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Mmh.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Shino purses her lips in a straight line, as though unsure what to say.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Akari and Hotori watch on, concern evident in their expressions.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"But when Akari opens her mouth to interject, Shino cuts her off with a pointed glance.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“All right, I'll give it to you straight.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's true that your status is everything I could want, but I'd never ask you to marry me just for that.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Shino bashfully lowers her gaze to the marriage certificate on the table.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“When you saved me yesterday, it did make an impression on me.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It made me realize I could trust you to have my back.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Not just 'cause of your skills or anything, but, y'know, for feelings-type reasons.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Shino mutters, a furious blush crossing her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Even Akari and Hotori's cheeks are tinged pink at this unexpected admission.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Unable to bear the silence any longer, Shino picks up the marriage certificate and hides her burning red face behind it.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Long story short, if it's my feelings we're talking about... I have no problems at all with marrying you.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Ohh... Please don't look at me.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Shino crouches down with embarrassment, burying her face in her hands.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...I can't believe I'm saying this, but Shino's cute.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah, my heart's going crazy.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Akari and Hotori's hearts have both been shot through by the cuteness of Shino's display.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That was totally a confession, wasn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Akari mercilessly kicks Shino while she's down.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yeah, that's right! It is a confession!”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I-I love him! I love Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“How could I ever, um, propose to someone I wasn't in love with?!”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Shino decides to lay it all out.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“S-Soujin, can you give me your answer?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Leaping to her feet, she pushes the marriage certificate against my chest.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Still, she refuses to meet my gaze, directing her flaming cheeks and wavering eyes firmly towards the ground.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Seriously, was Shino always ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"this",
{"/font"},
" cute?",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"It takes all my self-control to not sweep her up into my arms this very instant.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I suppose I should...”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"I take the marriage certificate from Shino's trembling hands.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Taking up the fountain pen on the desk, I write my name on the blank dotted line.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm not opposed to marrying you, either.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“No fair. I didn't get to say it like that.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"She takes another step forward, leaning up against my chest.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I went and laid all my feelings out there. It's only fair you do the same.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“If you're accepting my proposal, that must mean you love me back, right?”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"Shino peers up at me from point-blank range.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Out of the corner of my eye, I spot Akari and Hotori watching over us with bated breath.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Looks like there's no way out of this.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Not that I intended to run away, of course.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I love you too, Shino. And I respect you greatly.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It makes me happy from the bottom of my heart that you chose me.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yeah, I'm glad I did.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"I hold out the completed marriage certificate to her, and Shino takes it back.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"It's hard to believe the same person who expertly fielded the reporters' questions from last night is now showing me this expression of pure joy.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"─The strength of will to devote herself to saving the Empire even while her life is under threat by terrorists.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"─The unexpected femininity she'd always had hidden deep within her.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Just yesterday, I got to see so many different sides of this girl in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"And so it's only natural that she'd steal my heart.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"I turn to face Akari, lowering my head.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Though I'll be wed to Shino, my loyalty to you remains unyielding.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I swear to always come to your side when you have need of me.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll be just fine, no need to worry.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Empire's at peace now, and besides, I can't keep relying on you to protect me all the time.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You'd better shape yourself up and support her, you hear?”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Akari chides me with a carefree smile.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Miyaguni, you really okay with this?)”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(He's made up his mind. What else can I do?)”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Suddenly, the door to the student council office bursts open.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"An entire troop of camera operators immediately rush into the room.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Go ahead, boys. Do your thing.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"The men begin setting up their equipment with practiced efficiency.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“H-Hey, what's going on?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't ask me. How should I know?”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hehehee, they're the film crew for this TV drama I'm producing.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Shino declares, smugly crossing her arms.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You've probably heard the rumors about how my parents are totally head over heels for each other, right?”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm making a series about their whirlwind first meeting leading up to their marriage, which I've been broadcasting in the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It hasn't hit the air in the Empire yet, but over there, it's been a smash hit.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Another business you have your finger in?”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm actually not interested in the profits for once.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Don'tcha think a love story between an Imperial and a Republican is the perfect thing for bridging the gap between our countries?”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“After all, the people on the ground aren't gonna start getting along just 'cause their politicians shake hands and make up.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Shino flashes us a shrewd smirk.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"This is the sort of insight and method neither Akari nor I\nwould've ever come up with.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In that case, why aren't you off filming your parents?”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“We're already at the epilogue.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“The parents are living happily ever after, and the story wraps up with a few scenes showing how their daughter's doing.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That's why I wanna get some shots of me and Soujin holding hands at school.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“All you gotta do is walk around while holding my hand. Easy peasy, right?”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, I guess I can do that.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Great, it's settled.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"All smiles, Shino grabs my hand without the slightest hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Though her cheeks are still tinged with pink, the contented smile never leaves her face.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What were you gonna do if Soujin turned you down?”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“We prepped a script for that scenario too.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“'He left me heartbroken, but I'll come back stronger than\never!' Endings like that are pretty popular nowadays,\ndon'tcha think?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You can turn anything to your benefit, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That's just Business 101. We're gonna be spending the rest of our lives together, so better get used to it.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's you and me, in it for the long haul. You'd best believe\nI'm gonna run you ragged.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll be ready.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Though I crack a wry smile, my heart feels as light as a feather.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"As long as I have Shino by my side, it's seeming like my life\nwon't have another dull moment.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, I hate to ask this, but─”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah. Break a leg out there, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We'll be waiting here for you to get back.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Try to fix that grouchy resting face of yours when you're on camera, all right?”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"As the two of them wave me off, Shino and I head out the door.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"The filming takes us all around the school, from the classrooms to the gymnasium to the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"On top of all the location changes, it also isn't easy to keep up with their acting directions.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"I don't know the first thing about what it means to “act like\nyou're on cloud nine spending time with your lover,” or “act a little dejected when she lets go of your hand.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"The only scene I didn't need any guidance was the scene where I chased off a group of delinquents accosting Shino.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"But Shino is completely different.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"She flawlessly meets the demands of the film crew and steals the show as though she were a professional actress.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"It's a little late to be realizing this, but more and more, I'm catching on to the fact that the girl I'm marrying is truly incredible.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"The film shoot eventually comes to an end, and the two of us return to the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"It looks like Akari and Hotori have already left.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Whew, what a looong day.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You can say that again.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"We flop down next to each other on the sofa.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha, I don't think I've ever seen you so tired before.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The performing arts just might be the furthest thing from a warrior's calling.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now if it's blade arts we're taking about, I could keep it up all day.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Nah, man. Your performance was great.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Acting alongside you totally got my heart racing, y'know?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“With unease?”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yeah, some of that too.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Shino grins in amusement.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I know I'm hopeless, but don't you think you have some real talent for acting?”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Oh, no way.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm just a little used to it, that's all.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“If you think about it, representing the Group is a bit like acting, in a way. You have to play your role and tell people exactly what they wanna hear.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“If I can't at least act the part and talk the talk, I wouldn't be able to hold my own in negotiations.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Gotta feign modesty when you've got the upper hand, and put on airs when you don't, y'know?”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Real talk, though, sometimes it feels like I don't even know what my real feelings are anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds like a stressful job.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Well, I'd be lying if I said it wasn't.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Shino cracks her neck a few times, as though to dispel her anxieties.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Honestly, I'm worried.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't help but feel like I'm just going to hold you back.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hmm? Whatcha mean?”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Once we get married, I'll have to make appearances at those high society events, won't I?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I won't be able to laugh or cry just because the situation calls for it.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's okay. I never expected that outta you anyways.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mgh, I see.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"That's a load off my shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You're fine just the way you are.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Just keep being you and don't hold back from telling me what you're thinking.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That's enough to make me happy.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"Shino murmurs, leaning our shoulders together.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I think I can do at least that much.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Not that I'm one to talk, but the people you meet in this line of work are always saying one thing and thinking another.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And lemme tell you, it really gets to wear on you.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That's why it always feels like a breath of fresh air whenever I talk to you.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's like going skinny-dipping in a forest hot spring.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"I don't get the analogy, but I'm glad that she's happy about it.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That's the number-one reason I chose you.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Honestly, I never cared one bit about your nationality or your connections.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You're someone I can be myself in front of. That'll all there is to it.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If that means I can be of service to you, I could ask for nothing more.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“C'mon, stop being so modest.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You're the only one for me.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"Shino leans even closer, resting her head on my shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Would you take my first time?”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sure, I don't mi...”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"We both fall silent.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"Several seconds pass.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"All the while, Shino's face grows redder and redder.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Y-You didn't need to overthink it!”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“We're engaged already, so I don't think there's any need to hold ourselves back...”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, this is way too sudden.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Gotta strike while the iron's hot.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Y'know, we're gonna end up like that sooner or later. So\nwhat's the harm with doing it now?”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, you've got a point, but still...”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“First your proposal, and now this. I never know what's coming next with you.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If love were a battle, I'd be dead a dozen times over already.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Ahahaha, finally met your match?”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"Shino guffaws, puffing out her chest in a show of pride.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"But it's obvious she's only trying to cover up her embarrassment.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Um, if you really don't want to, I'll forget all about it.”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't be silly.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That settles it, then.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"Shino brings her face closer, peering up at me with moist, shimmering eyes.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"I could stare into those eyes─so full of wit and wisdom─forever.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"I hook my arm around Shino's waist and pull her in towards me.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Wh-When it comes down to it, it's still really embarrassing...”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And I thought I'd be able to at least handle a kiss no problem.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shino, close your eyes for me.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's all right. I can do this.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"Shino mutters to herself, her face full of determination.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"Even still, her trembling lips and quivering eyelashes betray just how nervous she must be.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"Screwing up her expression and puckering her lips, she slowly brings her lips to mine.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Fwah... nnmh, *smooch...*”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"Shino's lips are so soft and delicate that it's hard to believe that they're made of the same thing as my own.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Haahmn, nnm, nnmh...”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"We continue our kiss for several long seconds before pulling away.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
